WEBVTT - Most Fascinating Stories - Episode 337: Episode 337: The National Covenant of 1638

1
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:12.800
[Rebecca] Welcome to Most Fascinating Stories, where we uncover the real, well-sourced, and lesser-known tales behind history's most prominent figures and defining moments.

2
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.800
