50
00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:02.560
[George] In the wake of that supreme confrontation, the survivors looked out upon a world that had been forever transformed.

51
00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:10.960
[George] Victory and deliverance had been secured, but the cost in human suffering, physical exhaustion, and personal heartbreak was immense.

52
00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:20.000
